dsh-token-radar README · dsh-token-radar：> **Read-only, no external hosts.** The host half only reads `~/.dsh/sessions/**/*.zstd` and writes nothing;
> the browser makes exactly one request — a same-origin `GET` to this plugin's own host route.
> No telemetry, no third-party endpoints, no dependencies.

